# Astrans Global DMS — dual-core rules

## Accounting

- **Bigcapital** is the accounting/inventory valuation core (self-hosted Docker on VirtualBox now → dedicated PC later).
- Recreate Astrans COA from `docs/bigcapital/CHART_OF_ACCOUNTS.md`.
- VAT decision **1B**: bookkeeping VAT first; Sri Lanka schedules in `docs/bigcapital/VAT_SL_1B.md`.
- DMS stock/money events post per `docs/bigcapital/EVENT_POSTING_MATRIX.md`.

## Ops DMS

- Distribution workflows (routes, vans, collections UX) live in Astrans DMS, not rebuilt GL screens.
- Do not rebuild Trial Balance / Balance Sheet / P&L in Next.js while Bigcapital is core.

## Hosting

- Coolify + Cloudflare Tunnel on home/VirtualBox Ubuntu is expected for Bigcapital.
- **Never** recommend paid Oracle Cloud shapes (`oracle-always-free-only.mdc`).
- Bigcapital’s Redis/MySQL stay private on the VM — not public.

